3. LLM provider note
--------------------

Cycling Coach is a thin client that calls third-party LLM APIs through
the OpenAI-compatible protocol (default: OpenRouter). The LLM provider's
own terms of service govern your use of their models. Cycling Coach
sends only: (a) the activity metrics extracted from your local FIT file,
and (b) your typed chat message. No raw FIT files or personal data are
transmitted to anyone other than the configured LLM endpoint.

